IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sgd-compromise`
IMPORT `sgd-amalgamation`
IMPORT `sgd-amalgamation-solvency`

-- Tests for sgd-amalgamation-solvency.l4: Companies Act 1967, ss 215I and 215J.
-- Every expected value is written from the text (the comment beside it quotes the words), never from the module's output.
-- A line "-- EXPECT <word>" above a #TRACE says what the trace must print: FULFILLED, BREACH, or RESIDUAL (an obligation still open).

§ `Section 215I(1) and (2): the solvency statement in relation to an amalgamating company`

-- Fields, in order: it is a statement by the board; it says the opinion of (1)(a); it says the opinion of (1)(b); it is in the form of a written declaration; it is accompanied by the auditor's report.
sgd215I_ok MEANS `s 215I statement` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE
sgd215I_not_board MEANS `s 215I statement` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE
sgd215I_no_a MEANS `s 215I statement` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE
sgd215I_no_b MEANS `s 215I statement` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE
sgd215I_report_only MEANS `s 215I statement` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE
sgd215I_neither MEANS `s 215I statement` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE

-- (1): "a statement by the board of directors of the amalgamating company that it has formed the opinion (a) ...; and (b) ..."
#ASSERT `s 215I(1) the statement has the content the subsection requires` sgd215I_ok EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215I(1) the statement has the content the subsection requires` sgd215I_not_board EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215I(1) the statement has the content the subsection requires` sgd215I_no_a EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215I(1) the statement has the content the subsection requires` sgd215I_no_b EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (2)(a): a company exempt from audit: a written declaration. The report alone does not do.
#ASSERT `s 215I(2) the statement is in the form the subsection requires` sgd215I_ok TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215I(2) the statement is in the form the subsection requires` sgd215I_report_only TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215I(2) the statement is in the form the subsection requires` sgd215I_neither TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (2)(b): any other company: a written declaration, or the auditor's report
#ASSERT `s 215I(2) the statement is in the form the subsection requires` sgd215I_ok FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215I(2) the statement is in the form the subsection requires` sgd215I_report_only FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215I(2) the statement is in the form the subsection requires` sgd215I_neither FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (1) as a whole: the content and the form
#ASSERT `s 215I(1) the statement is a solvency statement in relation to the amalgamating company for the purposes of section 215C(2)(b)` sgd215I_ok TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215I(1) the statement is a solvency statement in relation to the amalgamating company for the purposes of section 215C(2)(b)` sgd215I_ok FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215I(1) the statement is a solvency statement in relation to the amalgamating company for the purposes of section 215C(2)(b)` sgd215I_report_only FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215I(1) the statement is a solvency statement in relation to the amalgamating company for the purposes of section 215C(2)(b)` sgd215I_report_only TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215I(1) the statement is a solvency statement in relation to the amalgamating company for the purposes of section 215C(2)(b)` sgd215I_not_board FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215I(1) the statement is a solvency statement in relation to the amalgamating company for the purposes of section 215C(2)(b)` sgd215I_no_b TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215I(1) the statement is a solvency statement in relation to the amalgamating company for the purposes of section 215C(2)(b)` sgd215I_neither FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Section 215I(3) to (6): how the board forms the opinion; the offence`

#ASSERT `s 215I(3) the directors have formed the opinion as the subsection requires` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215I(3) the directors have formed the opinion as the subsection requires` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215I(4)(a) the board has had regard to what the paragraph requires` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215I(4)(a) the board has had regard to what the paragraph requires` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215I(4)(a) the board has had regard to what the paragraph requires` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215I(4)(b) the board may rely on the valuation or estimate` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215I(4)(b) the board may rely on the valuation or estimate` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 215I(5) the board may take the matter into account in valuing a contingent liability` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215I(5) the board may take the matter into account in valuing a contingent liability` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215I(5) the board may take the matter into account in valuing a contingent liability` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (6): the person is a director of an amalgamating company; the person votes in favour of or otherwise causes the statement to be made; the director had reasonable grounds
#ASSERT `s 215I(6) the director is guilty of the offence this subsection creates` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215I(6) the director is guilty of the offence this subsection creates` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215I(6) the director is guilty of the offence this subsection creates` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215I(6) the director is guilty of the offence this subsection creates` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- "a fine not exceeding $100,000 or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding 3 years or to both": 36 months; both allowed
#ASSERT `s 215I(6) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` TRUE EQUALS JUST (`s 210(9) penalty` OF 100000, 36, TRUE, FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 215I(6) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 215J: the solvency statement in relation to an amalgamated company`

-- Fields, in order: it is a written declaration; it is by the board of directors of each amalgamating company; it says the opinion of (1)(a); it says the opinion of (1)(b).
#ASSERT `s 215J(1) the statement is a solvency statement in relation to the amalgamated company for the purposes of sections 215C(2)(c) and 215D(5)` (`s 215J statement` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215J(1) the statement is a solvency statement in relation to the amalgamated company for the purposes of sections 215C(2)(c) and 215D(5)` (`s 215J statement` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215J(1) the statement is a solvency statement in relation to the amalgamated company for the purposes of sections 215C(2)(c) and 215D(5)` (`s 215J statement` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215J(1) the statement is a solvency statement in relation to the amalgamated company for the purposes of sections 215C(2)(c) and 215D(5)` (`s 215J statement` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215J(1) the statement is a solvency statement in relation to the amalgamated company for the purposes of sections 215C(2)(c) and 215D(5)` (`s 215J statement` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215J(2) the directors have formed the opinion as the subsection requires` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215J(2) the directors have formed the opinion as the subsection requires` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215J(3)(a) the board has had regard to what the paragraph requires` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215J(3)(a) the board has had regard to what the paragraph requires` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215J(3)(a) the board has had regard to what the paragraph requires` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215J(3)(b) the board may rely on the valuation or estimate` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215J(3)(b) the board may rely on the valuation or estimate` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 215J(4) the board may take the matter into account in valuing a contingent liability` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215J(4) the board may take the matter into account in valuing a contingent liability` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215J(4) the board may take the matter into account in valuing a contingent liability` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 215J(5) the director is guilty of the offence this subsection creates` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 215J(5) the director is guilty of the offence this subsection creates` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215J(5) the director is guilty of the offence this subsection creates` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215J(5) the director is guilty of the offence this subsection creates` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 215J(5) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` TRUE EQUALS JUST (`s 210(9) penalty` OF 100000, 36, TRUE, FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 215J(5) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Regulative rules: traces`

-- The directors' duties in forming the opinion carry no time limit and no consequence of their own: no breach path (NOTES.md, "Rules with no breach path (sgd)").
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215I(3) a director must take into account all liabilities of the amalgamating company` "D" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director "D" DOES `s 215I(3) take into account all liabilities of the amalgamating company (including contingent liabilities)` AT 5
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 215I(3) a director must take into account all liabilities of the amalgamating company` "D" AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 500)
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215I(4)(a) the board must have regard to the most recent financial statements and all other circumstances` "A Co" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `s 215C the board of directors of an amalgamating company` "A Co" DOES `s 215I(4)(a) have regard to the most recent financial statements and all other circumstances` AT 5
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 215I(4)(a) the board must have regard to the most recent financial statements and all other circumstances` "A Co" AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 500)
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215J(2) a director must take into account all liabilities of the amalgamated company` "D" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Director "D" DOES `s 215J(2) take into account all liabilities of the amalgamated company (including contingent liabilities)` AT 5
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 215J(2) a director must take into account all liabilities of the amalgamated company` "D" AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 500)
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 215J(3)(a) the board must have regard to the most recent financial statements and all other circumstances` "A Co" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `s 215C the board of directors of an amalgamating company` "A Co" DOES `s 215J(3)(a) have regard to the most recent financial statements and all other circumstances` AT 5
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 215J(3)(a) the board must have regard to the most recent financial statements and all other circumstances` "A Co" AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 500)

-- Assertions written: 54. Assertions satisfied: 54 on 1.6.110 and 54 on 1.6.109 (check.sh); none failed, none refused.
